;; isic-packs — ISIC Rev.4 INDUSTRY PACK registry for open-kyber (Kyber ERP)
;; ADR-2606037200 · consumed by the erp-ontology (00-contracts/schemas/erp-ontology.kotoba.edn)
;;
;; PURPOSE
;;   The base open-kyber ERP is generic (the 8 core modules: accounting / ap-ar / hr /
;;   procurement / inventory / sales / asset / governance). The founder directive of
;;   2026-06-03 is "ISIC のすべての産業にそれぞれ対応した ERP" — every industry gets an ERP
;;   tailored to it. Rather than 428 forked ERPs, we ship ONE base + a PACK OVERLAY per
;;   ISIC Rev.4 section (21 packs, A..U) plus higher-resolution DIVISION packs where a
;;   section is too coarse (e.g. A splits farming vs fishing; C splits food vs metal vs
;;   electronics; K splits banking vs insurance). A tenant declares its ISIC activity
;;   codes (:erp.tenant/isic-codes); the loader resolves the matching pack(s) by
;;   section/division and writes :erp.tenant/active-packs. Records created thereafter carry
;;   :erp/isic-pack so coverage + compliance can be reported per industry.
;;
;; WHAT A PACK CONTAINS (overlay, additive — never removes a base module)
;;   :pack/modules-emphasis  — which base modules matter most + which get sector behaviour
;;   :pack/doc-types         — sector document types surfaced in suite/docs + drive
;;   :pack/uom               — units of measure the inventory module accepts (extends base)
;;   :pack/coa-ext           — chart-of-accounts extensions (sector-specific accounts)
;;   :pack/compliance        — gov.control frameworks pre-seeded for the sector
;;   :pack/kpis              — the dashboard metrics that matter for the sector
;;   :pack/actor-link        — etzhayyim Tier-B actor(s) whose domain this ISIC section is
;;                             (so the ERP for, e.g., agriculture aligns with sanae/mitsuho)
;;
;; SUBSTRATE: pack definitions are kotoba Datoms in graph "kyber-erp-v1" (visibility
;;   :public — pack DEFINITIONS are open catalog; only a tenant's ACTIVATION is :tenant).
;;   Money/decimal as STRING. No RisingWave. Murakumo-only for any pack-suggested AI assist
;;   (NL→journal templates per sector). All packs Apache-2.0 + Charter Rider.
;;
;; MATURITY: R0 = the 21 section packs + a first wave of high-value division packs are
;;   DECLARED here with real overlays; the loader + per-pack seed CoA land in the kotoba
;;   TS layer over the next iterations. Honest: overlays are :representative starting points,
;;   not a chartered-accountant's sector CoA. Division/class packs fill in incrementally.

{:schema/id      "isic-packs"
 :schema/version "0.1.0"
 :schema/adr     "2606037200"
 :schema/note    "21 ISIC Rev.4 section packs (A..U) + high-value division packs. Section→pack resolution mirrors open-isic sectionForDivision (60-apps/etzhayyim-project-open-isic/kotoba/src/types.ts). A tenant with no declared ISIC code falls back to the generic base (no pack)."
 :graph          {:name "kyber-erp-v1" :visibility :public}

